<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>SignalWire Browser SDK v2 Example</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="https://signalwire.com/favicon.svg">
    <!-- Fonts used by signalwire.com/docs: Lexend (body), Instrument Sans (headings), JetBrains Mono (code) -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lexend:wght@400;500;600&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-QWTKZyjpPEjISv5WaRU9OFeRpok6YctnYmDr5pNlyT2bRjXh0JMhjY6hW+ALEwIH" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link href="/css/app.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Cross-browser WebRTC adapter -->
    <script src="https://webrtc.github.io/adapter/adapter-latest.js"></script>
    <!-- SignalWire Browser SDK v2 (the `Relay` global). Pinned; see public/routes/verto_call.js -->
    <% if (sdk.mode === 'local') { %>
    <script src="/lib/index.min.js"></script>
    <% } else { %>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/@signalwire/js@<%= sdk.cdnVersion %>/dist/index.min.js"></script>
    <% } %>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container py-4">
    <header class="text-center mb-4">
        <h1 class="mb-2">SignalWire Browser SDK v2</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-3">Call browsers, SIP endpoints and phone numbers from this page using the <code>Relay</code> client.</p>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
            <a href="https://signalwire.com/docs/browser-sdk/v2/js" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm">v2 documentation</a>
            <span id="sdkBadge" class="sw-badge">SDK <%= sdk.loadedVersion %></span>
            <div id="themeToggle" class="btn-group btn-group-sm" role="group" aria-label="Colour scheme">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-theme-choice="system" aria-pressed="true">System</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-theme-choice="light" aria-pressed="false">Light</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-theme-choice="dark" aria-pressed="false">Dark</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">Connection</h2>
                    <form id="connectForm" novalidate>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label for="project" class="form-label">Project ID</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="project" name="project" autocomplete="off" data-persist required>
                            <div class="form-text">Prefilled from the server's <code>SIGNALWIRE_PROJECT</code>; change it to test another project.</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label for="resource" class="form-label">Resource name</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="resource" name="resource" autocomplete="off" placeholder="e.g. browser-test" data-persist required>
                            <div class="form-text">The Relay resource this browser registers as. Other endpoints dial it by this name.</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-check form-switch mb-2">
                            <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="durationSwitch" data-persist>
                            <label class="form-check-label" for="durationSwitch">Custom JWT duration</label>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3" id="durationWrap" hidden>
                            <label for="durationBox" class="form-label visually-hidden">JWT duration in minutes</label>
                            <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" class="form-control" id="durationBox" name="durationBox" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Minutes (default 15)" data-persist>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-check form-switch mb-3">
                            <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="autoRefresh" checked data-persist>
                            <label class="form-check-label" for="autoRefresh">Auto-refresh the JWT before it expires</label>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <span id="connectStatus" class="sw-status" data-state="disconnected" role="status" aria-live="polite">Not connected</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-grid gap-2">
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" id="btnConnect">Generate JWT and connect</button>
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-danger" id="btnDisconnect" hidden>Disconnect</button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                    <div class="mt-3">
                        <label for="token" class="form-label">JWT</label>
                        <div class="sw-token-row">
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="token" readonly placeholder="Generated on connect" aria-describedby="tokenExpiry">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" id="tokenCopy" aria-label="Copy JWT">Copy</button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-text" id="tokenExpiry">No token yet</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">Devices</h2>
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 flex-wrap mb-3">
                        <span id="permStatus" class="sw-status" data-state="" role="status" aria-live="polite">Connect to check</span>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" id="btnPermissions" disabled>Check permissions</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="micSelect" class="form-label">Microphone</label>
                        <select id="micSelect" class="form-select" data-kind-label="Microphone" data-persist disabled></select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="camSelect" class="form-label">Camera</label>
                        <select id="camSelect" class="form-select" data-kind-label="Camera" data-persist disabled></select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="speakerSelect" class="form-label">Speaker</label>
                        <select id="speakerSelect" class="form-select" data-kind-label="Speaker" data-persist disabled></select>
                        <div class="form-text" id="speakerNote" hidden>This browser cannot switch the output device (no <code>setSinkId</code>).</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" id="refreshDevices">Refresh list</button>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" id="applyDevices" disabled>Apply to live call</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-text mt-2">Lists fill after connecting. The selection is used for the next call and can be applied to a live call.</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">Options</h2>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="iceMode" class="form-label">ICE servers</label>
                        <select id="iceMode" class="form-select" data-persist>
                            <option value="platform">Platform default (sent by SignalWire on connect)</option>
                            <option value="none">None (host candidates only)</option>
                            <option value="custom">Custom list</option>
                        </select>
                        <div class="form-text">Applied per call through the <code>iceServers</code> option of <code>newCall</code>.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3" id="iceCustomWrap" hidden>
                        <label for="iceCustom" class="form-label">Custom ICE URLs</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="iceCustom" name="iceCustom" placeholder="stun:stun.example.com:3478, turn:turn.example.com:3478" data-persist>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="audioCodecs" class="form-label">Audio codecs</label>
                        <select id="audioCodecs" class="form-select" multiple size="5"></select>
                        <div class="form-text">All selected = browser default. Deselect to restrict the offer (page-level patch, not an SDK option).</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-0">
                        <label for="videoCodecs" class="form-label">Video codecs</label>
                        <select id="videoCodecs" class="form-select" multiple size="4"></select>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-12 col-lg-8">
            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">Call</h2>
                    <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="video-label">Local</div>
                            <video id="localVideo" class="video-frame" autoplay playsinline muted></video>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="video-label">Remote</div>
                            <video id="remoteVideo" class="video-frame" autoplay playsinline></video>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="incoming" class="sw-callout sw-incoming" data-intent="warning" hidden role="alert">
                        <div id="incomingTitle" class="mb-1">Incoming call</div>
                        <div class="sw-incoming-who"><span id="incomingName">Unknown caller</span> <span id="incomingNumber" class="sw-code"></span></div>
                        <div class="d-flex gap-2 mt-3">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="btnAnswer">Answer</button>
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-danger" id="btnDecline">Decline</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="row g-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label for="number" class="form-label">Call to</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="number" name="number" placeholder="Resource name or phone number" autocomplete="off" data-persist required>
                            <div class="invalid-feedback" id="numberError"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label for="numberFrom" class="form-label">Caller number (optional)</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="numberFrom" name="numberFrom" placeholder="A number owned by the project" autocomplete="off" data-persist>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-4 flex-wrap mt-3">
                        <div class="form-check form-switch">
                            <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="audio" checked data-persist>
                            <label class="form-check-label" for="audio">Audio</label>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-check form-switch">
                            <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="video" checked data-persist>
                            <label class="form-check-label" for="video">Video</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-2 mt-3">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary flex-fill" id="startCall" disabled>Start call</button>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-danger flex-fill" id="hangupCall" hidden>End call</button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <span id="callStatus" class="sw-status" data-state="idle" role="status" aria-live="polite">No call</span>
                        <dl id="callDetail" class="sw-kv mt-2"></dl>
                    </div>

                    <div id="controls" class="mt-3" hidden>
                        <h3 class="card-title">Controls</h3>
                        <div class="sw-controls">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" id="btnMute" aria-pressed="false">Mute</button>
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" id="btnDeaf" aria-pressed="false">Deaf</button>
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" id="btnHold" aria-pressed="false">Hold</button>
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" id="btnCamera" aria-pressed="false">Camera off</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="dtmfKeys" class="mt-4" hidden>
                        <h3 class="card-title">DTMF keypad</h3>
                        <div class="dtmf-grid" role="group" aria-label="DTMF keypad">
                            <% ['1','2','3','A','4','5','6','B','7','8','9','C','*','0','#','D'].forEach(function (key) { %>
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary dtmf-key" data-dtmf="<%= key %>"><%= key %></button>
                            <% }); %>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3">
                        <h2 class="card-title mb-0">Event log</h2>
                        <div class="d-flex gap-2 align-items-center flex-wrap">
                            <div class="form-check form-switch mb-0">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="debugToggle" data-persist>
                                <label class="form-check-label" for="debugToggle">Log socket messages</label>
                            </div>
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" id="copySummary">Copy call summary</button>
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" id="clearLog">Clear</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <ul id="eventLog" class="sw-log" aria-live="off" aria-label="Event log"></ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">Troubleshooting</h2>
                    <ul class="mb-0 small">
                        <li>"Permission missing" in Devices: allow the microphone and camera for this site, then click <em>Check permissions</em>.</li>
                        <li>Token request fails with a SignalWire status: the server's <code>SIGNALWIRE_API</code>, <code>SIGNALWIRE_PROJECT</code> or <code>SIGNALWIRE_SPACE</code> is wrong.</li>
                        <li>Status flips to "Reconnecting…": the socket dropped and the SDK is retrying. Watch the event log; a JWT expiry ends the session instead.</li>
                        <li>Codec or ICE experiments: change them before starting the call; they apply when the offer is created.</li>
                        <li>Use <em>Copy call summary</em> to paste the call ID, states, cause and recent events into a support ticket.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="toastContainer" class="toast-container position-fixed top-0 end-0 p-3"></div>

<script id="app-config" type="application/json"><%- JSON.stringify(config).replace(/</g, '\\u003c') %></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js" integrity="sha384-YvpcrYf0tY3lHB60NNkmXc5s9fDVZLESaAA55NDzOxhy9GkcIdslK1eN7N6jIeHz" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
<script src="/js/codecs.js"></script>
<script src="/js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
